# prlcp maps a 1x1 xdg_toplevel to own the Wayland clipboard while the
# VM is unfocused. Sway would otherwise tile it as a full container.
# Default floating_minimum_size is 75x50; drop it so resize set 1 1
# actually applies.
floating_minimum_size 1 x 1
for_window [title="^Parallels Shared Clipboard$"] floating enable, border none, resize set 1 1, move position 0 0
